WEBVTT

00:07.500 --> 00:09.090
<b>Oh, Shunpei.</b>

00:09.170 --> 00:11.760
<b>Are you eating in your room again?</b>

00:12.170 --> 00:14.720
<b>Does it matter where I am when I eat?</b>

00:14.800 --> 00:16.720
<b>I guess so.</b>

00:17.930 --> 00:21.350
<b>It just reeks of nerd.</b>

00:21.430 --> 00:22.560
<b>Shut up.</b>

00:31.490 --> 00:32.440
<b>I'm back.</b>

00:33.700 --> 00:34.860
<b>I brought you food.</b>

00:40.950 --> 00:41.750
<b>Here.</b>

02:42.620 --> 02:44.790
<b>Hey, Hitori.</b>

02:44.870 --> 02:46.790
<b>I'm not going to force you…</b>

02:47.500 --> 02:50.250
<b>But won't you tell me what happened?</b>

02:57.550 --> 02:59.720
<b><i>This has been going on for three days.</i></b>

03:00.340 --> 03:03.510
<b><i>He won't let me contact his parents, and…</i></b>

03:04.930 --> 03:07.270
<b><i>Wait. Did they abuse him?</i></b>

03:07.980 --> 03:10.640
<b><i>No, those two</i>
<i>would never be able to do that.</i></b>

03:12.060 --> 03:14.940
<b><i>Though… This is Origon Village after all.</i></b>

03:15.650 --> 03:18.530
<b><i>You saved me.</i></b>

03:19.280 --> 03:22.070
<b><i>Now it's my turn to do the same for you.</i></b>

03:24.120 --> 03:27.490
<b>It really isn't easy to live in this place.</b>

03:27.580 --> 03:30.370
<b>Everyone thinks there's
only one correct way to live,</b>

03:30.460 --> 03:32.710
<b>and they're all busy trying to fake that.</b>

03:32.790 --> 03:36.670
<b>But if you tip the lid a little,
all the issues come pouring out.</b>

03:37.840 --> 03:39.550
<b>My sister is the same.</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:41.630
<b>She used to do so well.</b>

03:41.970 --> 03:43.760
<b>-Shunpei.
-Crap.</b>

03:44.220 --> 03:46.850
<b>Your friend is here.</b>

03:46.930 --> 03:48.470
<b>Uh, okay.</b>

03:48.560 --> 03:49.600
<b>Got it.</b>

03:50.230 --> 03:51.390
<b>Who is it?</b>

03:53.440 --> 03:54.690
<b>Hello.</b>

03:58.650 --> 03:59.320
<b>Huh?</b>

03:59.900 --> 04:00.650
<b>Huh?</b>

04:01.820 --> 04:04.070
<b>How did you get outside?</b>

04:04.620 --> 04:07.410
<b>Umm, you see…</b>

04:07.490 --> 04:09.290
<b>I crawled out the window.</b>

04:09.370 --> 04:11.160
<b>Please let me back inside.</b>

04:11.250 --> 04:14.540
<b>Ah, uh, sure.</b>

04:15.500 --> 04:17.420
<b>But that's so strange, Hitori.</b>

04:18.630 --> 04:20.210
<b>-Akiyama.
-Huh?</b>

04:20.300 --> 04:22.050
<b>I'm thirsty.</b>

04:22.130 --> 04:24.050
<b>-Go make me some tea.
-What?</b>

04:25.140 --> 04:28.060
<b>You're too straight-forward.</b>

04:42.440 --> 04:43.570
<b>Migi.</b>

04:44.530 --> 04:46.200
<b>You're in there, aren't you?</b>

04:47.570 --> 04:49.030
<b>Listen, Migi.</b>

04:49.120 --> 04:50.450
<b>Come home already.</b>

04:51.830 --> 04:53.250
<b>The two of us</b>

04:53.330 --> 04:54.960
<b>have to get revenge on Eiji.</b>

04:55.620 --> 04:57.630
<b>The two of us have to be one.</b>

04:57.710 --> 04:58.420
<b>We have to.</b>

04:58.500 --> 05:00.000
<b>So come on.</b>

05:00.380 --> 05:01.300
<b>Migi!</b>

05:01.920 --> 05:04.340
<b>Open… it!</b>

05:09.470 --> 05:11.770
<b>Sorry, our tea leaves had gone bad.</b>

05:11.850 --> 05:13.430
<b>Is juice okay?</b>

05:13.520 --> 05:15.640
<b>Yeah. Thanks.</b>

05:20.940 --> 05:23.650
<b><i>Damnit. Can he just leave already?</i></b>

05:23.740 --> 05:25.400
<b>Hey, Hitori,</b>

05:25.490 --> 05:28.160
<b>you can help me study
to distract yourself a bit.</b>

05:28.240 --> 05:28.910
<b>Oh?</b>

05:28.990 --> 05:31.660
<b>I'd like to review
what we covered in class.</b>

05:31.740 --> 05:32.330
<b>Ah.</b>

05:33.410 --> 05:35.290
<b>Right, this bit.</b>

05:35.370 --> 05:39.000
<b>This is an inverse proportion,
so it becomes a hyperbola.</b>

05:39.080 --> 05:40.210
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

05:40.290 --> 05:43.300
<b><i>Damnit. I don't have time for this.</i></b>

05:43.380 --> 05:45.470
<b><i>I have to make Migi change his mind.</i></b>

05:47.220 --> 05:49.550
<b>Oh, did you hear that?</b>

05:49.640 --> 05:50.890
<b>No.</b>

05:50.970 --> 05:52.560
<b>Let's do the next one.</b>

05:52.640 --> 05:55.060
<b>I heard something coming from the closet.</b>

05:55.770 --> 05:57.640
<b>-Akiyama.
-What?</b>

06:06.900 --> 06:09.160
<b>I didn't mean to hurt you.</b>

06:10.990 --> 06:12.330
<b>Uh…</b>

06:12.410 --> 06:13.620
<b>All of this</b>

06:14.330 --> 06:16.210
<b>is to get revenge.</b>

06:16.870 --> 06:19.120
<b>Ah, oh, I'm sorry.</b>

06:19.210 --> 06:20.670
<b>I've been too careless.</b>

06:21.590 --> 06:24.210
<b>Even though I was
the one who wanted revenge.</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:26.880
<b>Though I didn't expect</b>

06:26.970 --> 06:29.760
<b>for you to be
this passionate about it, Hitori.</b>

06:30.300 --> 06:33.010
<b>Truly, a top student
is of a different caliber.</b>

06:33.100 --> 06:34.350
<b>Well, that's…</b>

06:35.810 --> 06:38.310
<b><i>Because it's a promise to mom.</i></b>

06:44.020 --> 06:45.610
<b>Hitori.</b>

06:45.690 --> 06:49.240
<b>You said you would get
first place again next time,</b>

06:49.320 --> 06:51.490
<b>did you not?</b>

06:52.490 --> 06:53.830
<b>Let's forget about it.</b>

06:53.910 --> 06:55.080
<b>About the revenge.</b>

06:55.160 --> 06:57.830
<b>You shouldn't pretend to be a model child</b>

06:57.910 --> 07:00.040
<b>just to live up to
your mom's expectations.</b>

07:00.580 --> 07:02.580
<b>Just set your true self free!</b>

07:04.130 --> 07:05.460
<b>My true…</b>

07:05.550 --> 07:06.550
<b>self…</b>

07:18.890 --> 07:21.520
<b>You're being so loud!</b>

07:21.600 --> 07:23.360
<b>Don't you know how late it is?</b>

07:23.440 --> 07:26.860
<b>‐Six hours past the Hour of the Rooster.
‐I'll kill you.</b>

07:30.450 --> 07:31.660
<b>Migi…</b>

07:34.070 --> 07:35.530
<b><i>Migi, what are you doing?</i></b>

07:35.620 --> 07:37.040
<b>Sorry about that, Hitori.</b>

07:37.120 --> 07:39.410
<b>To pick up where we left off…</b>

07:39.500 --> 07:41.170
<b>I don't care about revenge.</b>

07:41.250 --> 07:42.250
<b>Huh?</b>

07:42.330 --> 07:43.670
<b>Huh? Pardon?</b>

07:44.630 --> 07:49.670
<b>I won't take orders from anyone anymore.</b>

07:54.720 --> 07:56.890
<b>Oh, Hitori.</b>

07:56.970 --> 07:59.560
<b>You're ready to set yourself free!</b>

07:59.640 --> 08:03.480
<b>I suddenly feel like
jumping around outside!</b>

08:03.560 --> 08:04.650
<b>Let's go!</b>

08:06.610 --> 08:07.230
<b>Migi?</b>

08:07.320 --> 08:08.610
<b>Wait!</b>

08:27.040 --> 08:28.340
<b>I am!</b>

08:28.420 --> 08:32.420
<b>I am free!</b>

08:37.550 --> 08:39.220
<b>Mother.</b>

08:39.310 --> 08:40.390
<b><i>I will…</i></b>

08:44.390 --> 08:47.480
<b><i>I will avenge you. Alone, if I have to.</i></b>

08:50.530 --> 08:52.240
<b>Hitori!</b>

08:52.320 --> 08:54.450
<b>I waited for this.</b>

08:54.530 --> 08:56.200
<b>Guess what it is.</b>

08:58.240 --> 08:59.740
<b>-A fly.
-Nope.</b>

08:59.830 --> 09:02.160
<b>It's a mosquito!</b>

09:02.250 --> 09:05.080
<b><i>Next Sunday, at Origon Village Square,</i></b>

09:05.170 --> 09:07.920
<b><i>there'll be a Halloween costume contest.</i></b>

09:08.000 --> 09:10.380
<b><i>Aren't pumpkins or vampires too cliché?</i></b>

09:10.460 --> 09:13.380
<b>So you'll be a real dark horse,
a vampire mosquito!</b>

09:13.470 --> 09:17.510
<b>No one else will be wearing
the same thing and it has edge to it.</b>

09:18.300 --> 09:20.810
<b>She can't be serious about that bug.</b>

09:24.060 --> 09:25.730
<b>You wear it, Migi.</b>

09:29.020 --> 09:30.320
<b>Honestly,</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:35.990
<b>I wouldn't mind getting
my blood sucked dry by a Hitori mosquito.</b>

09:36.070 --> 09:37.660
<b>I know, right!</b>

09:37.740 --> 09:40.200
<b>You might even beat Eiji with this.</b>

09:40.280 --> 09:41.700
<b>Will Eiji be participating?</b>

09:41.790 --> 09:43.450
<b>Of course he will.</b>

09:44.660 --> 09:48.250
<b>He was dressed as
a famous painting last year and won.</b>

09:48.330 --> 09:50.960
<b>He was covered in gold leaves.</b>

09:51.500 --> 09:53.260
<b><i>Now this</i></b>

09:53.340 --> 09:55.380
<b><i>is practically perfect.</i></b>

09:56.340 --> 10:00.350
<b><i>Everyone can witness</i>
<i>Eiji's disgraceful demise.</i></b>

10:00.430 --> 10:02.390
<b>By the way, Hitori.</b>

10:02.470 --> 10:04.810
<b>You're not eating at all.</b>

10:04.890 --> 10:07.940
<b>You haven't even eaten
half as much as you use to.</b>

10:08.020 --> 10:09.190
<b>That's not true.</b>

10:10.980 --> 10:11.940
<b>Mmmh!</b>

10:12.900 --> 10:15.110
<b>It's good, it's really good.</b>

10:15.190 --> 10:16.780
<b><i>Get it together, Dali.</i></b>

10:16.860 --> 10:20.530
<b><i>I'm fine on my own without Migi.</i></b>

10:20.620 --> 10:22.580
<b><i>I don't need anyone else.</i></b>

10:23.830 --> 10:24.910
<b>Can I have seconds?</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:27.660
<b>That's the Hitori I know.</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:34.590
<b>It's fine.</b>

10:34.670 --> 10:36.130
<b>I'll get used to it.</b>

10:36.760 --> 10:37.840
<b>Eventually I will.</b>

10:41.390 --> 10:44.520
<b>It's been so long since
we've baked a pie together.</b>

10:44.600 --> 10:47.180
<b>I'll leave the braiding to you, okay?</b>

10:49.650 --> 10:50.770
<b><i>Calm down.</i></b>

10:52.230 --> 10:54.150
<b><i>All I have to do is alternate sides.</i></b>

10:56.030 --> 10:57.570
<b><i>I can do it on my own.</i></b>

11:06.660 --> 11:08.750
<b>Guess it's not bad.</b>

11:08.830 --> 11:12.920
<b>Though it looks more like
a whirlwind than a pie.</b>

11:14.670 --> 11:16.760
<b><i>Get it together, Dali.</i></b>

11:17.380 --> 11:20.180
<b><i>Revenge is so close you can almost feel it.</i></b>

11:21.260 --> 11:24.640
<b><i>You ought to be</i>
<i>able to do this on your own.</i></b>

11:25.390 --> 11:27.470
<b>Ow, ow, ow.</b>

11:28.850 --> 11:30.600
<b>-Dad.
-Yes?</b>

11:31.350 --> 11:33.560
<b>I'll massage your shoulders.</b>

11:33.650 --> 11:37.400
<b>That's nice. Do you want something?</b>

11:37.480 --> 11:38.780
<b>No, of course not.</b>

11:39.860 --> 11:42.490
<b><i>I can do it on my own.</i></b>

11:43.450 --> 11:45.120
<b><i>First, pummel with the right hand.</i></b>

11:45.870 --> 11:48.160
<b><i>Then knead with the left.</i></b>

11:48.250 --> 11:49.080
<b><i>No pauses.</i></b>

11:54.960 --> 11:56.800
<b>How is it, dad?</b>

11:56.880 --> 11:58.010
<b>Is it nice?</b>

12:00.170 --> 12:01.680
<b>Hitori.</b>

12:01.760 --> 12:02.970
<b>You can stop now.</b>

12:04.300 --> 12:05.220
<b>Huh?</b>

12:11.190 --> 12:12.940
<b>You're dripping with sweat.</b>

12:13.020 --> 12:15.940
<b>Let's go take a bath.</b>

12:22.360 --> 12:23.320
<b>Whoop.</b>

12:25.280 --> 12:27.080
<b>Do you want to try?</b>

12:27.160 --> 12:28.290
<b>Whoop!</b>

12:41.260 --> 12:42.130
<b>Whee.</b>

12:44.800 --> 12:46.550
<b>Mr. Duck has powered up.</b>

12:46.640 --> 12:47.850
<b>Whoo.</b>

12:47.930 --> 12:52.520
<b>The spray is stronger
from one source than from two.</b>

12:53.190 --> 12:55.810
<b>Try covering up one of its eyes.</b>

12:57.860 --> 13:00.530
<b>Whoa. Yes, that's right.</b>

13:01.320 --> 13:03.400
<b><i>It's really that easy.</i></b>

13:03.490 --> 13:07.490
<b><i>A single hole can fire</i>
<i>a stronger shot than two.</i></b>

13:07.570 --> 13:08.490
<b><i>Then…</i></b>

13:09.280 --> 13:12.120
<b><i>I just have to erase Migi from within me.</i></b>

13:12.750 --> 13:14.500
<b>Hitori.</b>

13:14.580 --> 13:17.420
<b>You're hitting my eyes.</b>

13:21.090 --> 13:24.510
<b>Hitori! How is it?</b>

13:29.260 --> 13:32.350
<b><i>Now the curtain rises</i>
<i>on the Revenge Act.</i></b>

13:36.940 --> 13:38.810
<b><i>Entry number 16.</i></b>

13:38.900 --> 13:40.940
<b><i>"A Beaver for One!"</i></b>

13:43.610 --> 13:45.610
<b>I'll make a dam.</b>

13:47.070 --> 13:49.280
<b>Gnaw, gnaw, gnaw.</b>

13:49.370 --> 13:51.950
<b>Oh, whoopsy-daisy.</b>

13:52.040 --> 13:56.580
<b>Grandma! You have to fall over like a tree.</b>

13:57.210 --> 13:58.920
<b><i> He's a bare-assed rodent.</i></b>

13:59.840 --> 14:01.750
<b><i> Entry number 29.</i></b>

14:01.840 --> 14:04.260
<b><i>"We Used to Have Wings."</i></b>

14:05.090 --> 14:06.510
<b><i>This is amazing!</i></b>

14:06.590 --> 14:08.890
<b><i>It's surpassed the real thing!</i></b>

14:10.180 --> 14:12.390
<b><i>That insolent bird-beast.</i></b>

14:12.930 --> 14:15.850
<b><i>The other bird remains immobile.</i></b>

14:15.930 --> 14:18.900
<b><i>It's a shoe-billed stork!</i></b>

14:18.980 --> 14:20.610
<b><i>It was never supposed to move!</i></b>

14:20.690 --> 14:22.730
<b>Geez. This whole thing is ridiculous.</b>

14:22.820 --> 14:24.150
<b>Don't you think so, Migi?</b>

14:25.610 --> 14:26.990
<b>Get it together.</b>

14:27.070 --> 14:29.160
<b>That's right, you have to.</b>

14:30.030 --> 14:32.240
<b>Hitori, you're up next.</b>

14:32.330 --> 14:36.790
<b>Remember, everyone will
vote for the winner.</b>

14:36.870 --> 14:38.920
<b>So make sure to be super charming.</b>

14:39.880 --> 14:41.880
<b>Sure, Mom.</b>

14:41.960 --> 14:45.550
<b><i>Next up is entry number 36.</i></b>

14:51.550 --> 14:55.770
<b><i>Tonight, your blood will not</i>
<i>be consumed by a vampire,</i></b>

14:55.850 --> 14:59.940
<b>but a vampire mosquito!</b>

15:00.020 --> 15:02.230
<b>-What is that?
-It's so ugly.</b>

15:06.030 --> 15:07.570
<b>That's so scary.</b>

15:07.650 --> 15:10.160
<b>What if it sucks my blood?</b>

15:10.240 --> 15:13.120
<b>Do not fear, I will protect you.</b>

15:13.200 --> 15:15.910
<b><i>Whoa, the mosquito!</i></b>

15:15.990 --> 15:18.080
<b><i>It is not drinking, it is spitting!</i></b>

15:20.000 --> 15:22.540
<b><i>Everyone is booing!</i></b>

15:22.630 --> 15:26.000
<b>Oh no, bad boy.</b>

15:26.630 --> 15:30.510
<b><i>There's no way I would</i>
<i>seriously play the role of a bug.</i></b>

15:30.590 --> 15:34.430
<b>Geez, Hitori. You were
a bit too avant-garde up there.</b>

15:34.510 --> 15:35.720
<b>Bzz-bzz.</b>

15:35.810 --> 15:40.810
<b>Though if it'd been a punk-rock contest,
you would've won for sure.</b>

15:40.890 --> 15:42.100
<b>‐For one second…
‐Hey.</b>

15:42.190 --> 15:45.400
<b>Do you reckon Eiji will win this year too?</b>

15:45.480 --> 15:46.570
<b>Obviously he will!</b>

15:46.650 --> 15:49.530
<b>Eiji wins each and every year.</b>

15:49.610 --> 15:52.570
<b>It's tradition for him
to sit on the throne of glory.</b>

15:52.660 --> 15:56.660
<b>Whoa, I'm so excited to
see his costume this year.</b>

15:59.120 --> 16:00.580
<b><i>Too bad.</i></b>

16:00.660 --> 16:04.630
<b><i>The throne this year is not one of glory,</i></b>

16:04.710 --> 16:07.090
<b><i>because I redesigned it a little.</i></b>

16:08.090 --> 16:11.260
<b><i>It's a throne of death,</i>
<i>covered in disgrace.</i></b>

16:11.340 --> 16:14.220
<b>Now, the moment
you have all been waiting for.</b>

16:14.300 --> 16:16.720
<b>The absolute king has arrived.</b>

16:16.810 --> 16:18.770
<b>Oh, Eiji is up next.</b>

16:18.850 --> 16:21.230
<b>Eiji Ichijo</b>

16:22.850 --> 16:24.310
<b>will show us…</b>

16:25.270 --> 16:28.150
<b>-Huh?
-What's wrong?</b>

16:29.440 --> 16:30.150
<b>Huh?</b>

16:31.200 --> 16:34.870
<b>Umm, what exactly are you dressed up as?</b>

16:35.620 --> 16:37.490
<b><i>I wonder what's wrong.</i></b>

16:37.580 --> 16:39.540
<b><i>He's not usually like this.</i></b>

16:39.620 --> 16:42.710
<b><i>What is this idiocy?</i></b>

16:43.460 --> 16:44.000
<b><i>No...</i></b>

16:45.830 --> 16:48.420
<b>It wasn't a ghost.</b>

16:49.460 --> 16:52.170
<b><i>Is that why? Now what do I do?</i></b>

16:52.260 --> 16:53.840
<b><i>He won't win like this.</i></b>

16:54.510 --> 16:56.350
<b>What a letdown.</b>

16:56.430 --> 16:59.180
<b>He definitely won't win this year.</b>

16:59.260 --> 17:01.770
<b><i>What do I do? How do I fix this?</i></b>

17:01.850 --> 17:05.150
<b>-He looks like a beggar.
<i>-That's it.</i></b>

17:05.230 --> 17:08.610
<b>‐I wonder what's wrong.
-That costume is…</b>

17:10.400 --> 17:11.030
<b>Huh?</b>

17:11.110 --> 17:13.360
<b>Then why isn't he holding anything?</b>

17:13.450 --> 17:15.780
<b>Oh, maybe it's because…</b>

17:17.160 --> 17:17.700
<b>No way!</b>

17:18.280 --> 17:20.080
<b>Did you know, Eiji's costume…</b>

17:26.960 --> 17:30.670
<b><i>This mosquito does not only drink blood.</i></b>

17:30.750 --> 17:34.510
<b><i>It also infects people with a certain idea.</i></b>

17:40.470 --> 17:42.270
<b>Oh, what is happening?</b>

17:42.350 --> 17:45.690
<b>The money offerings are pouring in!</b>

17:50.400 --> 17:52.860
<b>What exactly is going on?</b>

17:53.570 --> 17:55.860
<b>Ei… Eiji, he…</b>

17:55.950 --> 17:59.280
<b>He sold the instrument
he held so incredibly dear.</b>

17:59.370 --> 18:02.410
<b>So that he could buy
a single loaf of bread.</b>

18:02.490 --> 18:04.750
<b>Why did he need to buy that?</b>

18:05.370 --> 18:10.250
<b>To feed his starving little sister.</b>

18:10.790 --> 18:13.880
<b>You mean to say that Eiji is dressed as</b>

18:13.960 --> 18:15.670
<b>a beggar?</b>

18:15.760 --> 18:18.430
<b>No, can you not sense it?</b>

18:19.180 --> 18:22.470
<b>Even without his instrument, Eiji is</b>

18:22.560 --> 18:24.060
<b>a troubadour.</b>

18:25.890 --> 18:28.440
<b>He is still a poet at heart.</b>

18:37.360 --> 18:40.410
<b>Eiji Ichijo wins!</b>

18:40.490 --> 18:45.500
<b>An overwhelming victory
with 90% of all votes!</b>

18:47.830 --> 18:49.540
<b><i>Did you see that, Migi?</i></b>

18:49.630 --> 18:52.670
<b><i>I am perfectly capable on my own.</i></b>

18:53.300 --> 18:54.300
<b><i>Now…</i></b>

18:55.170 --> 18:57.130
<b><i>Once Eiji sits on the throne…</i></b>

19:03.640 --> 19:06.480
<b><i>He shall wear the crown of death.</i></b>

19:06.560 --> 19:08.940
<b><i>And I will have a front-row seat</i></b>

19:09.020 --> 19:10.940
<b><i>to witness</i></b>

19:11.020 --> 19:13.070
<b><i>your disgraceful death.</i></b>

19:14.480 --> 19:17.740
<b>Eiji, please move to the throne.</b>

19:25.370 --> 19:26.750
<b><i>Now.</i></b>

19:28.290 --> 19:29.710
<b>I decline.</b>

19:29.790 --> 19:30.790
<b>What?</b>

19:32.540 --> 19:36.130
<b>I have no right to become king.</b>

19:36.210 --> 19:37.840
<b>Amazing.</b>

19:37.920 --> 19:39.930
<b>He stays in character.</b>

19:40.010 --> 19:41.130
<b>I see.</b>

19:41.220 --> 19:43.100
<b>You choose the artistry above glory.</b>

19:43.180 --> 19:46.100
<b>There's no helping it.
We must respect a poet's wishes.</b>

19:46.180 --> 19:49.020
<b><i>-Wait.</i>
-In which case, the winner is…</b>

19:49.100 --> 19:52.440
<b>"We Used to Have Wings!"</b>

19:54.110 --> 19:57.530
<b>-Yay!
-Stop, let go!</b>

19:57.610 --> 19:59.150
<b>Move to the throne.</b>

19:59.240 --> 19:59.990
<b><i>Wait.</i></b>

20:00.070 --> 20:01.950
<b>Stop!</b>

20:09.870 --> 20:11.080
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

20:11.170 --> 20:13.920
<b>Oh, Hitori has changed costumes.</b>

20:14.000 --> 20:15.540
<b>That's adorable.</b>

20:16.420 --> 20:17.550
<b>Please come here.</b>

20:22.010 --> 20:22.720
<b>Migi!</b>

20:23.430 --> 20:25.180
<b>There, take your time.</b>

20:26.260 --> 20:28.640
<b>Hitori!</b>

20:30.730 --> 20:32.100
<b><i>Migi!</i></b>

20:36.650 --> 20:37.520
<b><i>Migi!</i></b>

20:44.530 --> 20:45.530
<b><i>Migi!</i></b>

20:56.790 --> 20:57.630
<b>Migi…</b>

21:00.460 --> 21:01.670
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

21:02.300 --> 21:03.550
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

21:04.220 --> 21:05.470
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

21:06.640 --> 21:08.140
<b><i>Migi!</i></b>
